 on frontier AI labs is officially kinetic. \n\nUsing your own models to reverse engineer physical bug hardware and trace the supply chain back to an insider is insane, but the real takeaway is obvious: weight security now requires full","url":"https://x.com/SkinbyJanus/status/2110126490629075343"},{"author_id":"1660622305880600577","created_at":"2026-10-13T21:54:54.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110127162011599092"],"id":"2110127162011599092","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"One of the biggest opportunities in AI right now might be the operational data sitting inside companies across India and Southeast Asia.\n\nThink about years of customer interactions, internal decisions, approvals and exceptions that have never been available on the public","url":"https://x.com/aryan_honawar/status/2110127162011599092"},{"author_id":"828587449299435520","created_at":"2026-10-13T21:56:50.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110127648223748495"],"id":"2110127648223748495","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":25,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"It's pretty surreal that frontier AI labs (namely Anthropic and OpenAI) have been meeting with religious leaders to discuss AI consciousness, and \"how to treat\" Claude (if the model does indeed wind up gaining a consciousness) 🤯\n\nIt's like.. good gracious, Ignatius!!\nEarthlings","url":"https://x.com/judeyblue/status/2110127648223748495"},{"author_id":"2085829967628431360","created_at":"2026-10-13T21:44:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110124429573591170"],"id":"2110124429573591170","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":0,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"An OpenAI engineer has been arrested after prosecutors say he planted a hidden audio-recording device in an executive conference room at the company’s San Francisco of